<%- include('header') %>
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="main-content" id="mainContent">
        <div class="content-header">
            <h1>✨ Dashboard Overview</h1>
            <p>Welcome back! Here's your stunning analytics at a glance.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cards-container">
            <div class="card">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Revenue</h3>
                <p>Total revenue generated this month. Up by 15% compared to last month with amazing growth.</p>
                <div class="stats">
                    <span><i class="fas fa-dollar-sign"></i> 24,580</span>
                    <span><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i> 15%</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-users"></i> Active Users</h3>
                <p>Active users in the last 30 days. Increased by 8% from previous period with steady engagement.</p>
                <div class="stats">
                    <span><i class="fas fa-user-friends"></i> 1,842</span>
                    <span><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i> 8%</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-fire"></i> Projects</h3>
                <p>Active projects currently in progress. 3 projects are nearing completion this week.</p>
                <div class="stats">
                    <span><i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i> 12</span>
                    <span><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> 3 due</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> Response Time</h3>
                <p>Average response time for support tickets. Decreased by 20% this month with better efficiency.</p>
                <div class="stats">
                    <span><i class="fas fa-stopwatch"></i> 2.4s</span>
                    <span><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i> 20%</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-sparkles"></i> About This Modern Design</h3>
            <p>This is a fully responsive glassmorphism admin panel built with cutting-edge HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. 
                The design features beautiful glass effects, smooth animations, and vibrant gradients that create a stunning 
                visual experience. The sidebar collapses on mobile devices and can be toggled using the hamburger menu.</p>
            <p>✨ Features include: Glassmorphism effects, smooth animations, responsive design, modern color palette, 
                and an intuitive user interface that works seamlessly across all devices.</p>
        </div>
    </main>
    </body>
    <%- include('footer')%>